 "quests": [
  {
   "copper": 38,
   "description": "The cenote receives our prayers, but someone with boots is receiving the offerings. Kill six Toll Bandits after dark in the Kezamba Canopy, which spreads in the northwest of Kezamba, and mind the Reed-Fang Vipers sharing those paths. We shall see how generous the spirits seem when the thieves stop walking away with their gifts.",
