   "title": "Even Seers Need Supper",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_047_host",
   "xp": 68
  },
  {
   "copper": 6,
   "description": "Taleko Drycord trades me reeds for smoked fish, a sensible friendship with something useful at both ends. Go to Whisperreed Landing in the Whispering Reedlands and give Taleko my regards. Ask what needs doing while you are there; the reeds always seem to be hiding another problem.",
   "giver": "r20_troll_capital_cook",
   "giver_name": "Teshani Smokereed",
