   "xp": 68
  },
  {
   "copper": 38,
   "description": "Pilgrims have been dropping their offerings and fleeing Jungle Razorbacks on the shrine paths. Hunters are driving the beasts there on somebody's coin; this is no ill omen, just a cruel trick. Kill six Jungle Razorbacks by day in the Kezamba Vinewood, in the west of Kezamba, so our people can finish a prayer standing still.",
