   "description": "My smokehouse racks need new hooks, and I have quite enough to hold without hanging supper from my own tusks. Bring me two Gnarled Boar Tusks from the Jungle Razorbacks in the Kezamba Vinewood. If Nalo has you hunting them by day already, remember that hungry people have prayers too.",
