   "copper": 19,
   "description": "The fire settles down, a fresh queue forms, and back I go to feeding Kezamba. Kill six Jungle Razorbacks by day in the Kezamba Vinewood for this repeatable bounty. You can take it again twenty minutes after turning it in; the city's appetite has no such pause.",
