   "copper": 45,
   "description": "Takka is paying the hunters, and Toll Bandit Archers guard the business at the Kezamba Tollcamp southwest from here. Kill six archers there. They will keep their distance, so close in or use the trees for cover; a blessing travels with you, but it is no substitute for a trunk.",
