  {
   "copper": 58,
   "description": "Bandit Offering-Broker Takka waits in the Kezamba Tollcamp southwest from here, selling stolen offerings back to the very pilgrims who brought them. Kill Takka and end this trade. Our people should kneel at the water because they choose to pray, never because a thief has emptied their hands twice.",
