   "description": "The Tithe Revenants wander the Kezamba Wildwood at night, in the south of Kezamba, still trying to pay what they owed when they died. They have started knocking at the smokehouse shutters as if I kept the ledger. Kill six of them, and let the poor things rest with the account closed.",
