   "description": "You have given the shrine room to breathe; now the Throng needs that strength beyond our boardwalks. Go to Thunderstep Watch in Thunderroot Wilds and speak with Rumela Stormstep, whose people face the Accord there. Take our drumbeat with you, even when you are too far away to hear it.",
