   "copper": 800,
   "description": "The canopy spirits asked me to settle a quarrel over fruit; the Glass-Knuckle Jungle Apes settled their part by throwing it at my messengers. Kill five by day in the Skyglass Cloudwood, which lies in the northwest of The Skyglass Canopy. A fistful of fruit is a poor argument, however loudly you make it.",
