   "description": "Our shrine drum needs a voice that will make even the canopy spirits sit up. Kill four Glass-Shadow Panthers at night in the Skyglass Cloudwood, which lies in the northwest of The Skyglass Canopy, and bring me two Glass Cat Claws. I'll do the playing. You have the difficult part: asking the cats for an instrument.",
